  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal model combining pca_n2000 (RNA) and resnet50 (image) features via simple concatenation, with no aggregation. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance, providing an initial baseline for multimodal integration. The effectiveness of this specific fusion strategy and encoder combination remains uncertain without comparative benchmarks."
